{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"N\u00e1v\u0161tevnos\u0165 UZ - obce (zahrani\u010dn\u00ed\/dom\u00e1ci)","update":"2026-09-11","note":"Vysvetlenie symbolov:\nVe\u013ek\u00e9 D                  \u00fadaj nie je mo\u017en\u00e9 publikova\u0165 pre jeho d\u00f4vern\u00fd charakter\nLe\u017eat\u00e1 \u010diarka (-)       jav sa nevyskytoval na \u00farovni krajiny p\u00f4vodu n\u00e1v\u0161tevn\u00edka (SR\/ zahrani\u010die)\nMal\u00e9 (u)                 \u00fadaj s ni\u017e\u0161ou spo\u013eahlivos\u0165ou\nPr\u00e1zdna bunka         jav sa nevyskytoval (regi\u00f3n nemal v sledovanom obdob\u00ed UZ alebo n\u00e1v\u0161tevnos\u0165)\nPozn\u00e1mky:\nD\u00e1tov\u00e9 kocky ubytovacej \u0161tatistiky obsahuj\u00fa inform\u00e1cie, na ktor\u00e9 \u0160tatistick\u00fd \u00farad SR (\u0160\u00da SR) aplikoval prim\u00e1rnu a sekund\u00e1rnu ochranu tak, aby \u00fadaje v mesa\u010dnej a n\u00e1sledne aj v \u0161tvr\u0165ro\u010dnej periodicite a takisto v ich \u010dasov\u00fdch kumulat\u00edvoch a jednotliv\u00fdch tabu\u013ek\u00e1ch neobsahovali d\u00e1ta d\u00f4vernej povahy a bola zabezpe\u010den\u00e1  ochrana d\u00f4vern\u00fdch \u00fadajov vypl\u00fdvaj\u00faca zo z\u00e1kona o \u0161t\u00e1tnej \u0161tatistike \u010d. 540\/2001 Z.z. \u00a7 2 g a \u00a7 30, a to nielen cez po\u010det ubytovac\u00edch zariaden\u00ed, ale i s oh\u013eadom na dominanciu hodn\u00f4t ubytovac\u00edch zariaden\u00ed.\nS\u00fabor spravodajsk\u00fdch jednotiek, ktor\u00e9 v mesa\u010dnej periodicite oslovujeme v\u00fdkazom s\u00fa v\u0161etky pr\u00e1vnick\u00e9 osoby a fyzick\u00e9 osoby s identifik\u00e1torom I\u010cO \u2013 podnikate\u013eov bez oh\u013eadu na po\u010det zamestnancov a hlavn\u00fa \u010dinnos\u0165, ktor\u00e9 s\u00fa veden\u00e9 v Registri ubytovac\u00edch zariaden\u00ed \u0160\u00da SR a poskytovali prechodn\u00e9 ubytovanie n\u00e1v\u0161tevn\u00edkom (akt\u00edvnym \u00fa\u010dastn\u00edkom cestovn\u00e9ho ruchu) v ubytovac\u00edch zariadeniach cestovn\u00e9ho ruchu.\nSpravodajsk\u00fa povinnos\u0165 nemaj\u00fa fyzick\u00e9 osoby poskytuj\u00face ubytovacie slu\u017eby tzv. \u201ezimmer frei\u201c, nako\u013eko  tieto nemaj\u00fa status podnikate\u013esk\u00e9ho subjektu. \u0160\u00da SR v\u00a0pravidelnej ro\u010dnej periodicite oslovuje v\u0161etky obce s\u00a0cie\u013eom z\u00edska\u0165 inform\u00e1cie o\u00a0podnikate\u013esk\u00fdch subjektoch\/prev\u00e1dzkovate\u013eoch a o samotn\u00fdch ubytovac\u00edch zariadeniach cestovn\u00e9ho ruchu sl\u00fa\u017eiace na aktualiz\u00e1ciu registra ubytovac\u00edch zariaden\u00ed.\nPridanie kvalitat\u00edvnych pr\u00edznakov k\u00a0\u0161tatistick\u00fdm inform\u00e1ci\u00e1m o n\u00e1v\u0161tevnosti a\u00a0kapacit\u00e1ch ubytovac\u00edch zariaden\u00ed za rok 2023.\npodrobnej\u0161ie inform\u00e1cie o\u00a0metodike zis\u0165ovania n\u00e1jdete na\nwww.statistics.sk \/ \u0160tatistiky \/ Odvetvov\u00e9 \u0161tatistiky \/ Cestovn\u00fd ruch \/ Meta\u00fadaje\nSpresnenie inform\u00e1ci\u00ed s\u00a0oh\u013eadom na s\u00eddlo ubytovacieho zariadenia a\u00a0zozbieran\u00e9 s\u00fahlasy so zverejnen\u00edm d\u00e1t za roky 2017-2023. \u00a0\nZdroj \u00fadajov:\n\u0160tatistick\u00fd \u00farad SR (Formul\u00e1r CR 1-12)\n","href":"http:\/\/datacube.statistics.sk\/#!\/view\/sk\/vbd_sk_win2\/cr3803mr\/v_cr3803mr_00_00_00_sk","id":["cr3803mr_obecagr","cr3803mr_rok","cr3803mr_mes","cr3803mr_ukaz","cr3803mr_dim3","cr3803mr_data"],"size":[1,10,12,2,3,1],"role":{"time":["cr3803mr_rok","cr3803mr_mes"],"geo":["cr3803mr_obecagr"],"metric":["cr3803mr_data"]},"dimension":{"cr3803mr_obecagr":{"label":"cr3803mr_obecagr","note":"Obce + Obce spolu","category":{"index":{"SK031B517402":0},"label":{"SK031B517402":"\u017dilina"}}},"cr3803mr_rok":{"label":"cr3803mr_rok","note":"Rok","category":{"index":{"2026":0,"2025":1,"2024":2,"2023":3,"2022":4,"2021":5,"2020":6,"2019":7,"2018":8,"2017":9}}},"cr3803mr_mes":{"label":"cr3803mr_mes","note":"Mesiac","category":{"index":{"9.":0,"8.":1,"7.":2,"6."